                        "entry_id": "364da816-c4b8-3e9f-b117-4161a5d51378",
                        "tags": [
                            "superlative"
                        ],
                        "form": "mushroomiest"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "463c877d-42d4-3685-91e8-92311da71e55",
                        "entry_id": "364da816-c4b8-3e9f-b117-4161a5d51378",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Characteristic of mushrooms."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "60738df0-3da8-4b71-9b72-0436b2864a13",
                                "sense_id": "463c877d-42d4-3685-91e8-92311da71e55",
                                "text": "the mushroomy smell of the old cellar"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0da895ad-3012-49a2-905e-68b83803bb35",
                                "sense_id": "463c877d-42d4-3685-91e8-92311da71e55",
                                "text": "Dried mushrooms are really mushroomier than the canned and very simple to use; they are used a great deal in Chinese and Italian cooking."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d802ec78-a85c-4276-b52f-4b8dfa157c70",
                                "sense_id": "463c877d-42d4-3685-91e8-92311da71e55",
                                "text": "It grew steadily colder and presently a mushroomy sort of smell came up from the darkness."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fe819baf-f3e2-409d-8d80-7553c9e27b58",
                                "sense_id": "463c877d-42d4-3685-91e8-92311da71e55",
                                "text": "Japanese may think of matsutake as the preeminent, mushroomiest mushroom of them all, but in the West, it is the poisonously beautiful, bright red, psychotropic, white-dotted member of the genus Amanita, Amanita muscaria, that is the much-cartooned representative ur-mushroom."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ec77ee09-927e-3f7b-9001-e0a74c96f941",
                        "entry_id": "364da816-c4b8-3e9f-b117-4161a5d51378",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Resembling a mushroom."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c83192da-1fd9-4419-b780-d12498d1b9c2",
                                "sense_id": "ec77ee09-927e-3f7b-9001-e0a74c96f941",
                                "text": "Near-synonyms: mushroomoid, mushroomlike; fungiform"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a60d8478-77b1-4188-9152-1a37a7024389",
                                "sense_id": "ec77ee09-927e-3f7b-9001-e0a74c96f941",
                                "text": "a mushroomy outline of a passing cloud"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "0c173f71-dc3c-303f-b369-de5136c15878",
                        "entry_id": "364da816-c4b8-3e9f-b117-4161a5d51378",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Flavoured with mushrooms."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "2f6bdebd-d821-4e2c-8f0c-bc3399043f2b",
                                "sense_id": "0c173f71-dc3c-303f-b369-de5136c15878",
                                "text": "the mushroomy tang of her favorite soup"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6681c0f5-b70d-45e8-bb16-99efddae879e",
                                "sense_id": "0c173f71-dc3c-303f-b369-de5136c15878",
                                "text": "What follows are simple party recipes that are naturals for casual indoor entertaining: endive stuffed with garlicky goat cheese, herbs and sun-dried tomatoes; a mushroomy pasta salad; asparagus, lima beans, leeks and fennel tossed in an all-green salad; a grilled vegetable sandwich; a fig upside-down cake, and, of course, brownies."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9f866622-581e-4849-9cb9-39087018b695",
                                "sense_id": "0c173f71-dc3c-303f-b369-de5136c15878",
                                "text": "The scallops are pounded and watchfully cooked to maximize their callow tenderness, which is further italicized by the mushroomiest sauce on the block, glowing with fine Marsala wine."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "aed7a7c3-b397-40b5-820d-98dca1da1ff0",
                                "sense_id": "0c173f71-dc3c-303f-b369-de5136c15878",
                                "text": "You can’t have an ail-American cookbook without a great gravy recipe. No can do, so we worked hard to get you the creamiest, mushroomiest, low-fat version of the gravy of your childhood and this one did it."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "aa9ee680-5701-4bda-b411-53b711a3c227",
                                "sense_id": "0c173f71-dc3c-303f-b369-de5136c15878",
                                "text": "In a cool, colonial dining room overlooking the Malacca river, he demonstrates three such recipes: a mellow, mushroomy chicken curry (ayam pong the), a fiery okra salad (sambal bendeh), and – a personal favourite – a spicy, oniony shrimp-paste omelette (cincalock omelette)."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "dbaf6b1b-9efb-4da7-929f-8360231fb5fe",
                                "sense_id": "0c173f71-dc3c-303f-b369-de5136c15878",
                                "text": "I folded my mushroomy pizza into my paper napkin and pushed it away from me along with dreams of Mom bringing pancakes to the table or baking cookies."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5a1e2747-16eb-4cbb-aef6-6a13bccd2e0f",
                                "sense_id": "0c173f71-dc3c-303f-b369-de5136c15878",
                                "text": "Charlie found me the saltiest, mushroomiest hard cheeses."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
